- ### Splitting
+ ### Repartir

- `share` divides an amount into a number of parts which sum exactly to the whole. Any remainder
- is distributed one minor unit at a time. This is the allocation problem which naive division
- gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
+ `share` divide una cantidad en un número de partes que suman exactamente el total. El resto que
+ pueda haber se distribuye de unidad menor en unidad menor. Es el problema del reparto que la
+ división ingenua resuelve mal: tres partes iguales de 3,01 € perderían un céntimo.

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
=
= ```scala fuel
- run
+ run

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
